# InkGen Studio Environment Variables
# ------------------------------------
#
# Copy this file to a new file named .env and fill in your API keys.
# The .env file is ignored by Git, so your keys will not be committed.
#
# You can provide one or more Gemini API keys, separated by commas.
# The system will rotate through these keys for each request.
#
# Example:
# GEMINI_API_KEYS=your_key_1,your_key_2,your_key_3

GEMINI_API_KEYS=YOUR_API_KEY_HERE